2. Preventive measures to secure the administrativ e sanctioning applied according to administrative 
procedures to acts of infringing upon intellectual property rights include: a/ Temporary custody of persons; 
b/ Temporary custody of infringing go ods, material evidence and means; 
c/ Body search; 
